# Example environment for Vite. The game needs no secrets, API keys or backend.
# Copy to .env.local only if you want to override something locally (.env.local is git-ignored).
#
# VITE_PLATFORM selects the portal integration at build time:
#   (unset)  the game's own build: no SDK, no ads           → npm run build
#   poki     Poki's SDK and ads (set by .env.poki)          → npm run build:poki
# VITE_PLATFORM=poki
